# reflect.repos — the repos you dogfood Relay in, one absolute path per line.
# Copy to `reflect.repos` (gitignored) and edit. `#` comments and a leading `~` are allowed.
#
# /reflect and scripts/reflect-gather.sh pool the Relay trail from every repo listed here.
# List your REAL projects — the ones that exercise the full loop — not just the Relay repo,
# which uses Relay the least.

~/Documents/castlesERP
# ~/Documents/another-project
# ~/Documents/relay        # include this repo too if you want its own trail in the mix
